    "text": "Ananya Panday's Shava Shava moment\nOn November 5, Ananya Panday and her stylist, Priyanka Kapadia, took to Instagram Stories to post a collage of Rani Mukerji's lehenga from Shava Shava, with the caption “Mood tonight,” and tagged Manish Malhotra. After hinting at the inspiration behind the look, they posted videos of Ananya in a modern take on the iconic sequinned lehenga, dancing to the song.",
